{"version":2,"exportedAt":1777650893951,"story":{"title":"The Sand Dune Donkey and the Genie's Grin","userPrompt":"A wild donkey ride in the hot Arabic dessert with a powerful geenie","authorStyleId":"shel-silverstein","readingLevel":"growing","illustrationStyleId":"colored_pencil","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Zizi the donkey, with ears so long,\nFelt the hot sun, where he belonged.\nAcross the desert, wide and grand,\nHe wished for a friend, close at hand.","illustrationPrompt":"A small, fluffy donkey named Zizi, with big, expressive eyes and very long ears, stands on a vast sand dune. He looks a little lonely. The sun is a bright, friendly yellow disk in a clear blue sky. The sand is a warm, golden color. Whimsical children's book style, friendly and colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650855149,"durationMs":4317,"retries":0,"promptLength":646,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A medium light tan fur with slightly darker mane and tail donkey, large-expressive warm brown eyes with wistful expression, exceptionally long, expressive ears that droop slightly when sad, a small, curious smile often plays on his lips, a slightly dusty appearance from the desert, stocky but agile build. Zizi the donkey standing in a vast desert landscape, looking towards the horizon with a wistful expression. in wide and grand desert landscape. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"Then a puff of smoke, a smoky swirl,\nBrought a genie, with a curly whirl!\nHe wore a vest of starry night,\nAnd twinkled with a magic light.","illustrationPrompt":"A puff of bright blue and purple smoke is swirling in the air. Emerging from the smoke is a friendly, smiling genie with a turban and a sparkly vest. He has kind eyes and a gentle expression. The desert sand is still visible. Whimsical, magical, and colorful illustration.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650855533,"durationMs":4682,"retries":0,"promptLength":759,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A large smoky, iridescent blue with swirling patterns of light magical creature, large-round bright, twinkling gold eyes with magical expression, wearing A shimmering vest made of dark, starry fabric. He has no other visible clothing, his lower body is the swirling smoke of his form., his form is made of swirling smoke, constantly in motion, a wide, infectious grin that seems to glow, he emits a soft, magical twinkle, ethereal, smoky build. A puff of smoky swirl appearing in the desert, from which the genie is emerging, looking magical. in desert landscape. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"\"Hello!\" boomed the genie, with a happy sound,\n\"I'm here to help, all around!\nWhat do you wish, little donkey friend?\"\nZizi blinked, 'A ride, till the very end!'","illustrationPrompt":"The genie, now fully visible, is leaning down towards Zizi with a wide, encouraging smile. Zizi looks up at the genie with a hopeful expression. The genie's vest sparkles. The desert landscape stretches out behind them. Bright and cheerful illustration.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650855470,"durationMs":4618,"retries":0,"promptLength":1082,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A medium light tan fur with slightly darker mane and tail donkey, large-expressive warm brown eyes with hopeful expression, exceptionally long, expressive ears that droop slightly when sad, a small, curious smile often plays on his lips, a slightly dusty appearance from the desert, stocky but agile build. A large smoky, iridescent blue with swirling patterns of light magical creature, large-round bright, twinkling gold eyes with friendly expression, wearing A shimmering vest made of dark, starry fabric. He has no other visible clothing, his lower body is the swirling smoke of his form., his form is made of swirling smoke, constantly in motion, a wide, infectious grin that seems to glow, he emits a soft, magical twinkle, ethereal, smoky build. The genie speaking to Zizi, who is looking surprised and hopeful. The genie has a friendly and helpful demeanor. in desert landscape. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"So Zizi hopped on, with a joyful leap,\nAnd the genie made the sand dunes creep!\nNot fast and scary, oh no, not so,\nBut a gentle sway, a happy flow.","illustrationPrompt":"Zizi the donkey is now happily perched on the genie's shoulders. The genie is walking, and the sand dunes around them are gently rippling and moving, like soft waves. Zizi has a big smile. The genie looks amused and content. Warm colors, whimsical movement.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650859330,"durationMs":4179,"retries":0,"promptLength":1116,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A medium light tan fur with slightly darker mane and tail donkey, large-expressive warm brown eyes with joyful expression, exceptionally long, expressive ears that droop slightly when sad, a small, curious smile often plays on his lips, a slightly dusty appearance from the desert, stocky but agile build. A large smoky, iridescent blue with swirling patterns of light magical creature, large-round bright, twinkling gold eyes with mischievous expression, wearing A shimmering vest made of dark, starry fabric. He has no other visible clothing, his lower body is the swirling smoke of his form., his form is made of swirling smoke, constantly in motion, a wide, infectious grin that seems to glow, he emits a soft, magical twinkle, ethereal, smoky build. Zizi joyfully hopping onto the genie's back (or hand/swirl of smoke) as the sand dunes gently sway and flow around them. in desert landscape with flowing sand dunes. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"They zoomed past cacti, tall and green,\nThe funniest ride you've ever seen!\nWith laughter bubbling, light and free,\nJust Zizi and the genie, happy as can be.","illustrationPrompt":"Zizi and the genie are gliding smoothly over the sand. They are passing by some playful-looking, friendly cacti. Zizi is braying with laughter, and the genie has a wide grin. The sky is a bright, cheerful blue. Whimsical motion lines showing their smooth ride.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650860885,"durationMs":5413,"retries":0,"promptLength":1098,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A medium light tan fur with slightly darker mane and tail donkey, large-expressive warm brown eyes with happy expression, exceptionally long, expressive ears that droop slightly when sad, a small, curious smile often plays on his lips, a slightly dusty appearance from the desert, stocky but agile build. A large smoky, iridescent blue with swirling patterns of light magical creature, large-round bright, twinkling gold eyes with happy expression, wearing A shimmering vest made of dark, starry fabric. He has no other visible clothing, his lower body is the swirling smoke of his form., his form is made of swirling smoke, constantly in motion, a wide, infectious grin that seems to glow, he emits a soft, magical twinkle, ethereal, smoky build. Zizi and the genie riding together, passing by tall green cacti. Both characters are laughing and looking very happy. in desert landscape with tall cacti. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"The genie told tales of stars so bright,\nAnd Zizi shared secrets of the desert night.\nThey learned that friends, both big and small,\nMake every journey the best of all.","illustrationPrompt":"Zizi and the genie are sitting together on a soft sand dune, looking up at the sky. A few friendly stars are beginning to appear. The genie is gesturing to the stars, and Zizi is listening intently with his ears perked. Cozy and warm atmosphere.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650860576,"durationMs":5027,"retries":0,"promptLength":1123,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A medium light tan fur with slightly darker mane and tail donkey, large-expressive warm brown eyes with engaged expression, exceptionally long, expressive ears that droop slightly when sad, a small, curious smile often plays on his lips, a slightly dusty appearance from the desert, stocky but agile build. A large smoky, iridescent blue with swirling patterns of light magical creature, large-round bright, twinkling gold eyes with engaged expression, wearing A shimmering vest made of dark, starry fabric. He has no other visible clothing, his lower body is the swirling smoke of his form., his form is made of swirling smoke, constantly in motion, a wide, infectious grin that seems to glow, he emits a soft, magical twinkle, ethereal, smoky build. Zizi and the genie sitting together, perhaps on a sand dune or a magical platform, sharing stories. Both appear engaged and happy. in desert landscape, perhaps on a sand dune. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"The sun began to dip and fade,\nA lovely, golden promenade.\n\"It's time to go,\" the genie sighed,\n\"But we'll meet again, with joy and pride!\"","illustrationPrompt":"The sun is setting, casting a warm, golden orange glow across the desert. Zizi and the genie are standing together. The genie looks a little sad but also hopeful. Zizi nuzzles the genie's hand. The sand dunes are bathed in soft, warm light.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650864058,"durationMs":4723,"retries":0,"promptLength":1126,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A medium light tan fur with slightly darker mane and tail donkey, large-expressive warm brown eyes with understanding expression, exceptionally long, expressive ears that droop slightly when sad, a small, curious smile often plays on his lips, a slightly dusty appearance from the desert, stocky but agile build. A large smoky, iridescent blue with swirling patterns of light magical creature, large-round bright, twinkling gold eyes with melancholy expression, wearing A shimmering vest made of dark, starry fabric. He has no other visible clothing, his lower body is the swirling smoke of his form., his form is made of swirling smoke, constantly in motion, a wide, infectious grin that seems to glow, he emits a soft, magical twinkle, ethereal, smoky build. The sun is setting in the desert, casting a golden light. The genie is looking a bit sad but also proud, as he tells Zizi it's time to go. in desert landscape at sunset. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"With a final wink and a shimmering gleam,\nHe vanished like a waking dream.\nZizi watched the smoke drift high,\nBeneath the vast and starry sky.","illustrationPrompt":"The genie is dissolving into wisps of sparkling smoke that drift upwards into the darkening sky, where a few early stars are visible. Zizi is standing on the sand, looking up with a gentle smile. The desert is peaceful and quiet. Soft, magical colors.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650865285,"durationMs":4704,"retries":0,"promptLength":1109,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A medium light tan fur with slightly darker mane and tail donkey, large-expressive warm brown eyes with observant expression, exceptionally long, expressive ears that droop slightly when sad, a small, curious smile often plays on his lips, a slightly dusty appearance from the desert, stocky but agile build. A large smoky, iridescent blue with swirling patterns of light magical creature, large-round bright, twinkling gold eyes with magical expression, wearing A shimmering vest made of dark, starry fabric. He has no other visible clothing, his lower body is the swirling smoke of his form., his form is made of swirling smoke, constantly in motion, a wide, infectious grin that seems to glow, he emits a soft, magical twinkle, ethereal, smoky build. The genie is vanishing in a shimmering gleam and smoke, leaving Zizi looking up at the vast, starry night sky. in desert landscape at night, with a starry sky. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"Though Zizi was alone once more,\nHis heart was full, right to the core.\nHe knew that kindness, true and deep,\nWas a promise friends would always keep.","illustrationPrompt":"Zizi is standing alone on the sand dune, but he has a happy, contented smile on his face. He is looking out at the desert. The moon is starting to rise in the starry sky. The overall feeling is peaceful and warm.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650865064,"durationMs":4173,"retries":0,"promptLength":626,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A medium light tan fur with slightly darker mane and tail donkey, large-expressive warm brown eyes with content expression, exceptionally long, expressive ears that droop slightly when sad, a small, curious smile often plays on his lips, a slightly dusty appearance from the desert, stocky but agile build. Zizi standing alone in the desert, but with a content and warm expression, looking towards the viewer. in desert landscape. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":10,"text":"And in the desert, warm and wide,\nZizi knew friendship would always ride.\nA happy donkey, with ears so grand,\nAnd a genie's grin, across the land!","illustrationPrompt":"Zizi the donkey is trotting happily across the moonlit desert. He has a big smile and his ears are perked up. In the distance, a faint shimmer of magic suggests the genie is still nearby, watching over his friend. A warm, happy, and reassuring conclusion.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650868647,"durationMs":4577,"retries":0,"promptLength":671,"success":true,"prompt":"colored pencil illustration, crayon drawing style, hand-drawn texture, warm sketchy lines, child-like artistic charm, textured coloring A medium light tan fur with slightly darker mane and tail donkey, large-expressive warm brown eyes with happy expression, exceptionally long, expressive ears that droop slightly when sad, a small, curious smile often plays on his lips, a slightly dusty appearance from the desert, stocky but agile build. A happy Zizi standing in the desert, with a subtle hint of the genie's grin or a magical sparkle in the background, representing enduring friendship. in desert landscape. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}}],"generationMeta":{"textModel":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","imageProvider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650825024,"totalDurationMs":47226,"textGenerationMs":13,"imageGenerationMs":49915,"totalImages":11,"successfulImages":11,"failedImages":0,"appVersion":"2.5.52","buildVersion":"77","firstBatchImageMs":30497,"timeToDisplayMs":30510},"coverImageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1777650872245,"duratio